# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docker build context excludes.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything not listed here ships in the
# image. Keep this file honest: only exclude things proven not to be loaded
# at runtime by `main_api:app` (the container's entrypoint).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Virtualenvs (two of them live in this repo) ---
venv/
nba_env/

# --- VCS / build metadata ---
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# --- Databases and API cache (bootstrap_db.py downloads these at boot) ---
Data/*.sqlite
Data/*.sqlite-shm
Data/*.sqlite-wal
Data/nba_cache/

# --- Secrets ---
.env

# --- Python bytecode / tooling artifacts ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.mypy_cache/
.idea/
.claude/

# --- Node / legacy Flask UI ---
node_modules/
Flask/

# --- Logs ---
daily_update.log
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# XGBoost models.
#
# LOAD-BEARING - these two MUST stay in the image. Both are referenced by
# explicit, hardcoded relative paths (no globbing, no filename pattern
# matching, no "pick the highest accuracy" logic anywhere in the codebase):
#
#   main_api.py:317-318         Models/XGBoost_Models/XGBoost_68.9%_ML-3.json
#                               Models/XGBoost_Models/XGBoost_54.8%_UO-8.json
#   src/Predict/XGBoost_Runner.py:15,17   (same two files)
#
# Every other .json under Models/ is a superseded training checkpoint written
# by src/Train-Models/*.py and read by nothing that runs in the container.
# Excluded by exact filename so a future model rename cannot silently drop the
# wrong file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Superseded UO checkpoint in the live model dir (62 MB, replaced by UO-8).
# See the "Changed from 53.7% to 54.8%" comment in XGBoost_Runner.py:17.
Models/XGBoost_Models/XGBoost_53.7%_UO-9.json
# Superseded ML checkpoint (replaced by ML-3). See XGBoost_Runner.py:15.
Models/XGBoost_Models/XGBoost_68.7%_ML-4.json

# Stale training checkpoints in Models/ root - no code path loads these.
# (Models/XGBoost_ML.json is read only by simple_main.py, which is not an
#  entrypoint; train_model.py writes it. Neither runs in the container.)
Models/XGBoost_53.1%_UO-9.json
Models/XGBoost_53.6%_UO-9.json
Models/XGBoost_53.8%_UO-9.json
Models/XGBoost_65.3%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_65.5%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_65.9%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_66.7%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_66.8%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_67.7%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_68.1%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_68.5%_ML-4.json
Models/XGBoost_ML.json

# NOTE: Models/NN_Models/ is deliberately NOT excluded. It is loaded by
# src/Predict/NN_Runner.py and it is only ~5 MB - not worth the risk.

# --- Raw dunk scrape dumps (~102 MB). No Python in this repo reads them; the
#     /stats/dunk-scores page ships its own copy of the derived data at
#     basic-saas-starter/src/app/(app)/stats/dunk-scores/dunk_scores_data.json ---
all_real_dunks.json
real_dunks_2425_reg.json
dunk_data.json
dunk_scores_data.json
scrape_dunks_regex.py

# --- Tests, notebooks, screenshots, scratch work: not imported by main_api ---
Tests/
Personal_Tests/
scratch/
Screenshots/
ColabNotebook.ipynb
notes.txt
inspect_db.py
inspect_model.py
test_predictions.py
